     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You can use addResourcePath. For example addResourcePath(&#39;shared&#39;, &#39;path/to/shiny/shared&#39;) will point all resources prefixed with shared to the path pointed to. This way you can specify an absolute path where you have your common resources stored.</div>"
